age":2,"uses":82}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GEN","chapter":49,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Zebulun shall dwell by the seashore and become a harbor for ships; his border shall extend to Sidon.","from":10},{"book":"DEU","chapter":33,"verse":18,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Concerning Zebulun he said: “Rejoice, Zebulun, in your journeys, and Issachar, in your tents. They will call the peoples to a mountain; there they will offer sacrifices of righteousness. For they will feast on the abundance of the seas and the hidden treasures of the sand.”","from":10},{"book":"JOS","chapter":11,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now when Jabin king of Hazor heard about these things, he sent word to Jobab king of Madon; to the kings of Shimron and Achshaph;","from":15},{"book":"JOS","chapter":12,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the king of Shimron-meron, one; the king of Achshaph, one;","from":15},{"book":"JOS","chapter":12,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the king of Kedesh, one; the king of Jokneam in Carmel, one;","from":11},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When you have mapped out the seven portions of land and brought it to me, I will cast lots for you here in the presence of the LORD our God.","from":10},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The first lot came up for the clans of the tribe of Benjamin. Their allotted territory lay between the tribes of Judah and Joseph:","from":10},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The border reached Tabor, Shahazumah, and Beth-shemesh, and ended at the Jordan. There were sixteen cities, along with their villages.","from":12}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"17-23":{"people":[{"id":"issachar-h3485g","name":"Issachar","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse"