 גַּנִּים","tr":"en gan·nim","gloss":"En-gannim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H1366","lemma":"גְּבוּל","tr":"ge·vul","gloss":"border: boundary","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":240},{"base":"H1053","lemma":"בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ","tr":"bet she·mesh","gloss":"Beth-shemesh","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":42},{"base":"H2691","lemma":"חָצֵר","tr":"cha·tser","gloss":"court","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":191},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":303},{"base":"H7191","lemma":"קִשְׁיוֹן","tr":"qish·yon","gloss":"Kishion","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H7766","lemma":"שׁוּנֵם","tr":"shu·nem","gloss":"Shunem","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1SA","chapter":28,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"The Philistines gathered together and camped at Shunem, while Saul gathered all Israel and camped at Gilboa.","from":18},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From Sarid it turned eastward along the border of Chisloth-tabor and went on to Daberath and up to Japhia.","from":18},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From Sarid it turned eastward along the border of Chisloth-tabor and went on to Daberath and up to Japhia.","from":22},{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":38,"verseEnd":38,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Iron, Migdal-el, Horem, Beth-anath, and Beth-shemesh. There were nineteen cities, along with their villages.","from":22},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Ain, Juttah, and Beth-shemesh—nine cities from these two tribes, together with their pasturelands.","from":22},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Jarmuth, and En-gannim—four cities, together with their pasturelands.","from":21},{"book":"JDG","chapter":4,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"She summoned Barak son of Abinoam from Kedesh in Naphtali and said to him, “Surely the LORD, the God of Israel, is commanding you: ‘Go and march to Mount Tabor, taking with you ten thousand men of Naphtali and Zebulun.","from":22},{"book":"1SA","chapter":6,"verse":9,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"but keep watching it. If it goes up the road to its homeland, toward Beth-shemesh, it is the LORD who has brought on us this great disaster. But if it does not, then we will know that it was not His hand that punished us and that it happened by chance.” So the men did as instructed. They took two milk cows, hitched them to the cart, and penned up their calves. Then they put the ark of the LORD on the cart, along with the chest containing the gold rats and the images of the tumors. And the cows headed straight up the road toward Beth-shemesh, staying on that one highway and lowing as they went, never straying to the right or to the left. The rulers of the Philistines followed behind them to the border of Beth-shemesh. Now the people of Beth-shemesh were harvesting wheat in the valley, and when they looked up and saw the ark, they were overjoyed at the sight.","from":22}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"24-31":{"people":[{"id":"asher-h0836","name":"Asher","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":24},{"id":"zebulun-h2074","name":"Zebulun","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":27}],"places":[{"id":"achshaph-h0407","name":"Achshaph","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"beten-h0991","name":"Beten","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"hali-h2482","name":"Hali","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"helkath-h2520","name":"Helkath","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"allammelech-h0487","name":"Allammelech","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"amad-h6008","name":"Amad","kind":"place","brie