nasseh (a tribe of Joseph), Gaddi son of Susi;","from":30},{"book":"DEU","chapter":33,"verse":24,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And concerning Asher he said: “May Asher be the most blessed of sons; may he be the most favored among his brothers and dip his foot in oil. May the bolts of your gate be iron and bronze, and may your strength match your days.”","from":31},{"book":"JOS","chapter":11,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now when Jabin king of Hazor heard about these things, he sent word to Jobab king of Madon; to the kings of Shimron and Achshaph;","from":25},{"book":"JOS","chapter":11,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and the LORD delivered them into the hand of Israel, who struck them down and pursued them all the way to Greater Sidon and Misrephoth-maim, and eastward as far as the Valley of Mizpeh. They struck them down, leaving no survivors.","from":28}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"32-39":{"people":[{"id":"naphtali-h5321g","name":"Naphtali","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"asher-h0836","name":"Asher","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":34},{"id":"zebulun-h2074","name":"Zebulun","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":34}],"places":[{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"adami-nekeb-h0129","name":"Adami-nekeb","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"allon-h0438g","name":"Allon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"heleph-h2501","name":"Heleph","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"jabneel-h2995h","name":"Jabneel","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":33},{"id":"lakkum-h3946","name":"Lakkum","kind":"place","brief":"",